<title>USA: Suffolk Bancorp names Edward Merz chairman.</title>
<headline>Suffolk Bancorp names Edward Merz chairman.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERHEAD, N.Y. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suffolk Bancorp said Monday it named its president and chief executive Edward Merz to the additional role of chairman, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Merz replaces Raymond Mazgulski, who will serve as vice chairman, the company said.</p>
</text>
